<title>USA: Dycom says completes merger.</title>
<headline>Dycom says completes merger.</headline>
<dateline>PALM BEACH GARDENS, Fla. 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dycom Industries Inc said Wednesday that it has consummated a merger with Communications Construction Group Inc.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed</p>
<p>Under the deal, Communications Construction, a West Chester, Pa., firm that provides construction and engineering services to the telecommunications industry, will become a wholly owned subsidiary of Dycom.</p>
<p>Communications Construction's current management will continue to manage the operations.</p>
<p>Dycom provides fiber optic transmission, comprehensive services installations, other telephone engineering, and electrical services to the telecommunications and electrical utilities industries.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
